OL,11,G0530 BBC News Summary
OL,12,     FThe latest two minute news summary
OL,13,     Ffrom BBC World Service.
OL,14,G0532 Asia Specific
OL,15,     FRobusta coffee is holding up far
OL,16,     Fbetter than arabica as the climate
OL,17,     Fwarms, and no country grows more
OL,18,     Fof it than Vietnam. The question
OL,19,     Fnow is whether Vietnam can
OL,20,     Factually cash in.
