OL,6,     FJulius Yego became the first
OL,7,     FKenyan to win a World Championship
OL,8,     Fgold medal in a field event.
OL,9,     FNicknamed Mr YouTube Man, Yego
OL,10,     Ftaught himself the javelin by
OL,11,     Fwatching online videos.
